      {
        "card_id": "002202",
        "transcript": "The software saves time; besides, it shortens staff training from a month to two weeks.",
        "target_signal": "在“并列/递进关系”任务中依据题面证据完成选项判断",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002203",
        "transcript": "The plan lowers energy use. Moreover, it improves indoor comfort during winter.",
        "target_signal": "识别追加的好处",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002204",
        "transcript": "The policy improved attendance and also raised homework completion; more importantly, it reduced dropout rates.",
        "target_signal": "根据录音材料准确理解并列/递进关系",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002205",
        "transcript": "The team hired more staff, upgraded devices, and finally linked data across departments, which cut response time dramatically.",
        "target_signal": "根据录音材料准确理解并列/递进关系",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002206",
        "transcript": "We redesigned the form, added online support, and simplified approval steps; therefore, customer satisfaction rose far beyond our target.",
        "target_signal": "根据录音材料准确理解并列/递进关系",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002207",
        "transcript": "The new reading room is much quieter than the old one. In addition, every desk has a power socket, so students can charge their laptops while they study.",
        "target_signal": "听出追加的第二项收益",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002208",
        "transcript": "The volunteers showed new students around the campus and helped them set up their library accounts. They also stayed near the entrance to answer questions during the afternoon.",
        "target_signal": "区分共同主语下的两项行动",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002209",
        "transcript": "The library now lends laptop chargers at the front desk. In addition, students can borrow headphones for use in the reading room. Both services are free, but a student card is required.",
        "target_signal": "根据录音中的完整材料识别并列/递进关系",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002210",
        "transcript": "The evening bus will run more often next term. It will also stop outside the new residence, so students living there will no longer need to walk to the main road.",
        "target_signal": "根据录音中的完整材料识别并列/递进关系",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002211",
        "transcript": "The online form is easy to complete. Moreover, it saves your progress automatically, so you can finish the application later if you are interrupted.",
        "target_signal": "区分递进与转折",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "002212",
        "transcript": "Before submitting the application, check that your contact details are correct. You should also make sure that all required documents are attached. A complete form without the attachments will still need to be returned.",
        "target_signal": "概括两项并列要求",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
